BT /F2 12.0 Tf 72.00 367.20 Td (4 Limitations) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 72.00 350.60 Td (Our study has several limitations. All experiments use classification tasks and a single model size,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 72.00 337.00 Td (so it is unclear whether the gains hold for text generation or for models with billions of parameters. In) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 72.00 323.40 Td (addition, noisy labels may receive persistently high losses; in such cases SCS could repeatedly) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 72.00 309.80 Td (sample mislabeled examples and amplify the noise.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.0 Tf 72.00 279.80 Td (5 Conclusion) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 72.00 263.20 Td (We presented Sparse Curriculum Sampling, a lightweight method that reuses the training loss to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 72.00 249.60 Td (decide which examples deserve more attention. The method reduces the cost of fine-tuning in our) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 72.00 236.00 Td (setting and is easy to combine with existing training pipelines. Future work will study adaptive values) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 72.00 222.40 Td (of alpha and robustness to label noise.) Tj ET
